comments[18]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-05T10:52:21.298Z",codex-agent,"Seeded model passed 500 random sequences against SDK read-back. Packed npm and Bun journeys passed with Git absent, including npx bunx native SDK TOON JSON and refused writes. Public scratch tracker-copy measurement read 173 items, defined 38 distinct terms and 44 senses, resolved 42 of 42 scoped probes and abstained on all 10 ambiguous or unknown probes. Three bounded packets retained witnesses: 35580 bytes and 8896 estimated tokens versus 130362 bytes and 32591 tokens of selected source passages, saving 72.71 percent; wall time 17104 ms. Bindings are explicitly deferred by the first-slice plan."
  "2026-11-05T11:26:54.364Z",codex-agent,"Final review tightened JSON submissions to reject inherited, accessor and hidden properties before reading them, and checked same-line independent statement counters with a positive tooling fixture. All 40 tests passed in the previous full run; one valid-contrast branch was missing and now has a regression assertion. The stricter gate correctly refused that 99.55 percent branch result rather than rounding it to approval. A redundant Windows privacy pattern triggered the identity scanner; the shared separator pattern covers that case and its refusal corpus now includes a Windows-shaped example."
  "2026-11-05T12:34:04.377Z",codex-agent,"Budget-hint boundary experiment found 10 of 20 SDK minimum estimates did not fit when retried exactly, because receipt digits changed. The package now verifies retry budgets in at most four fitter passes and reports no usable budget above the hard ceiling. Twenty exact-retry probes and failing-fitter cases pass. The real-data proof now directly pins four copied tracker descriptions as a fourth scope; reviewed meanings distinguish release verification from package publication. Current receipt: 38 terms, 48 senses, 46/46 scoped probes, 10/10 abstentions, 40217 packet bytes and 10056 estimated tokens versus 132732 source-passage bytes and 33183 tokens, saving 69.70 percent in 18880 ms. Every expected and actual probe and the refused budget are recorded in docs/real-data.md."
  "2026-11-05T12:50:06.361Z",codex-agent,"Final npm run release:check passed all 13 stages under an isolated HOME with Git global and system config disabled: 40 tests passed, zero failures or skips; independent emitted-source coverage 426/426 statements, 271/271 branches, 108/108 functions and 360/360 lines across nine runtime modules. Packed acceptance passed two Git-free npm and native Bun journeys using one unchanged archive and npx/bunx host dispatch. Behavioral revert gate produced all three expected failures; unchanged implementation then passed both selected regressions. Bun gate is running serially. Exact native cost/cursor compatibility remains the separate yrza release blocker."
  "2026-11-05T13:05:07.020Z",codex-agent,"The corrected domain head passed the previous 13-stage npm gate: 41 tests, 428/428 statements, 275/275 branches, 108/108 functions and 362/362 lines. Additional CI reproduction found pm health --strict-exit also mandates optional Git integration, even in a clean standalone clone. Public RunHealthOptions documents that coupling. CI now uses scripts/tracker-health.ts and fails on the authoritative SDK result.ok with checkOnly/full enabled and requireMergeDrivers false; durable integrity, history drift and extension checks remain enforced. A real plain tracker passes and deliberately corrupted scratch history exits nonzero. No merge installation, configuration or history repair was performed. The new tracker:health stage brings release:check to 14 stages. Both full gates will certify this final tooling change."
  "2026-11-05T13:06:40.636Z",codex-agent,"Expanded automated disposable-copy revert proofs all passed: first-candidate ambiguity, unconditional owner update, removed SDK secret admission, schema validation after registration and ignored native health verdict each caused the intended regression to fail. The unchanged implementation then passed all four selected restored regressions. Lint, typecheck and zero-duplication gates also pass for the final health caller."
  "2026-11-05T13:39:33.129Z",codex-agent,"Final source commit 389a1f6 passed npm run release:check and bun run release:check: 14/14 stages each, 42/42 suite tests each with zero failures/skips; 1/1 packed test with two journeys and 4/4 restored regressions each; all five behavioral reverts fail as intended. Independent production coverage: 428/428 statements, 275/275 branches, 108/108 functions, 362/362 lines across nine modules. Zero lint violations, clone pairs and production audit vulnerabilities; 63 declarations documented. Separate Node 22.19.0 and 26.13.0 packed tests passed both npm/npx and native Bun/bunx journeys with Git absent. All four captures have the same SHA-256 and 43 allowlisted files. Both OS-writer runs acknowledged and preserved 17 writes with three explicit conflicts out of 20. Machine-readable receipts and addressed SDK quirks are in docs/verification.json."
  "2026-11-05T13:56:50.432Z",codex-agent,"Review round 1: fetched all seven unresolved threads and every comment at b51a19c; latest CodeRabbit review has no Outside diff range section. Remote branch is current and includes main. All seven findings verified: restrict GitHub web-flow identity to committer, avoid repeated state validation in packet and single-term read paths, assert exact refusal codes, decode corpus file URLs, compare reviewed definitions, and require ambiguous results to be unusable. Will add targeted regression and behavioral mutation proofs, inspect the complete PR for related instances, and run unchanged npm and Bun release gates. No thread replies or resolutions."
  "2026-11-05T14:04:46.386Z",codex-agent,"Implemented all seven findings. GitHub noreply entry matches the pm-http allowlist but is accepted only for the exact GitHub committer name, never as an author. Packet pages and single-term API reads reuse readGlossary validation; the public raw-state resolver still validates. New tests count real schema validations and exercise synthetic Git histories. Refusal assertions now read the structured envelope because the pinned SDK harness leaves its top-level errorCode unset for returned refusal envelopes. Self-review tightened cursor, crash, malformed stored-state and host-error assertions, gold-definition checks in model and packed consumers, and ambiguity usability assertions. Focused commands/contracts: 6/6 pass; identity/corpus regressions: 4/4 pass; lint, duplication 0 percent, and docstrings pass. Dependency install preserved the pinned lockfile."
  "2026-11-05T14:07:50.546Z",codex-agent,"Revert proof: npm run test:revert passed with 16 expected behavioral failures in disposable copies, then 10/10 restored tests passed with zero skips. PRRT_kwDOVkA9os60GFT3: removing noreply allowlist entry fails the accepted GitHub commit fixture; removing the author exclusion fails the forbidden-author fixture. PRRT_kwDOVkA9os60GFUI: restoring original validating resolver calls separately in packet and API fails the one-validation assertion. PRRT_kwDOVkA9os60GFUh: removing write receipt reservation fails exact output_budget versus invalid_input assertion. PRRT_kwDOVkA9os60GFUp: misclassifying submitted control text, missing record, or unsupported version separately fails exact-code assertions. PRRT_kwDOVkA9os60GFUy: restoring URL pathname fails decoded sibling path assertion. PRRT_kwDOVkA9os60GFU4: changing definitions with identical sense IDs fails the gold corpus. PRRT_kwDOVkA9os60GFVA: making ambiguous results usable fails the root abstention assertion. Existing ambiguity truncation, unguarded write, secret-admission, schema-registration-order and health-verdict mutations also fail. Source checkout was never mutated by these proofs. Development-only audit follow-up: pm-glossary-7zl7."
  "2026-11-05T14:10:25.207Z",codex-agent,"The linked npm run test:real-data passed on the read-only copied public tracker with definition equality and root-usability checks enabled. An initial runner invocation was refused because pm-context none requires workspace isolation; rerunning with tracker context and source workspace passed. No product test failed in that refusal. Identity/privacy gate passed over all 85 staged files, and every existing changed history file preserves main as a byte prefix."
  "2026-11-05T14:53:31.779Z",codex-agent,"Final review tree passed npm run release:check and bun run release:check serially through pm test with an isolated HOME and Git configuration: 14/14 stages each; 45/45 suite tests, 1/1 packed acceptance test with both npm/npx and Bun/bunx journeys, and 10/10 restored regressions each; zero failures, skips, cancellations, todos or timeouts. All 16 disposable behavioral mutations failed as intended in each gate. Coverage is unchanged at exactly 100 percent across nine emitted modules: 428/428 statements, 275/275 branches, 109/109 functions and 362/362 lines. The 500-sequence oracle recorded 742 writes, 500 reads, 273 replays and 227 explicit refusals on each run. Pack gate: 43 allowlisted files. Lint clean; duplication zero; 63 declarations documented; production audit zero vulnerabilities. The copied public tracker check separately passed 46/46 reviewed meanings and 10/10 abstentions over 173 copied items. No retries were required for either release gate despite shared host load. dist is ignored rather than committed and was rebuilt. All seven threads were valid and are fixed; no threads were replied to or resolved. Existing publication and native-output-control blockers remain. The three moderate development-only advisory entries remain tracked separately in pm-glossary-7zl7."
  "2026-11-05T15:25:07.249Z",codex-agent,"Bounded CI wait ended near the 30-minute cutoff: implementation head dbff4fef1918b40ca2a859e73b2e262a576a9911 still has CI queued (Node 22 and Node 26 jobs): https://github.com/unbraind/pm-glossary/actions/runs/42049622974 ; CodeQL is also queued: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-glossary/actions/runs/42049622957 . Neither workflow has executed, so remote CI verification remains pending; the skipped dependabot-auto-merge workflow is not approval. Both full local release gates and all recorded revert proofs passed without timeouts or retries. This follow-up records queue evidence only, with no implementation or threshold change. Claim remains released and item remains in_progress for orchestrator verification. No threads were replied to or resolved; no merge or release occurred."
  "2026-11-05T15:42:36.534Z",codex-agent,"Review round 2 at 5c64956: branch is current and includes main. Fetched all five unresolved threads with complete comments and latest CodeRabbit review (no Outside diff range section). All findings verified: PR synthetic merge identity, polynomial email privacy regex (two threads), source-checkout prerequisites, local CLI installation order, and nested emitted package inventory. Open code-scanning API returns no default-branch alerts; PR review identifies CodeQL alert 1. Compare pm-http post-baseline range and test actual PR and push commit graphs without widening author policy. Add disposable regression reverts, self-review related instances, run unchanged npm and Bun release gates. No thread replies or resolutions."
  "2026-11-05T15:48:11.622Z",codex-agent,"Round 2 implementation: PR identity audits use merge-base(base SHA, real head SHA)..real head SHA from the event; push audits use before..after, with an initial-push fallback. The author allowlist is unchanged. Real Git fixtures include an advanced base, an unapproved synthetic merge author, clean tips above invalid real author or committer commits, push-to-main and initial push, empty PR range and malformed event SHAs. Anchored email-local-part matching retains privacy behavior and checks three maximal adversarial strings using a CPU budget. Pack validation now uses emitted inventory for nested and punctuated module paths, retaining stale-source, undeclared-asset and missing-entrypoint refusals. README npm/Bun install order and source-corpus prerequisites are corrected. Four focused regressions pass through pm test. Typecheck, lint, 63 documented declarations, zero duplication and generated changelog checks pass. The initial focused fixture reused an identical empty commit; unique fixture messages corrected that test setup before the passing run. CodeQL alert 1 is confirmed open specifically on refs/pull/1/merge (js/polynomial-redos). No additional instances found in the full PR review."
  "2026-11-05T15:49:11.178Z",codex-agent,"Revert proof round 2: npm run test:revert passed with 22 expected behavioral failures in disposable copies and 13/13 restored regressions passing, no skips. Identity: removing the PR-event range restores synthetic-merge rejection; replacing push before..after with an empty range fails real-commit enforcement. PRRT_kwDOVkA9os60Iw5u and PRRT_kwDOVkA9os60JDc2: removing only the email local-part start boundary fails the adversarial CPU-time assertion. PRRT_kwDOVkA9os60JDci: restoring only the flat runtime path rule fails the nested emitted-module fixture. PRRT_kwDOVkA9os60JDcZ: moving activation before installation fails npm/Bun documentation ordering. PRRT_kwDOVkA9os60JDb2: deleting only the source-checkout prerequisite paragraph fails the documentation contract. All 16 earlier behavioral mutations still fail. The fixed checkout was never mutated; every disposable mutation was deleted, and the unchanged implementation passed the selected tests afterwards."
  "2026-11-05T16:11:10.672Z",codex-agent,"Round 2 final local validation passed serially through pm test under isolated HOME and disabled global/system Git config: npm run release:check and bun run release:check each passed 14/14 stages, 48/48 suite tests, 1/1 packed acceptance test covering npm/npx and native Bun/bunx journeys, 22/22 expected disposable behavioral mutation failures and 13/13 restored regressions. Zero failed, skipped, cancelled or todo tests; neither gate needed retries or hit a timeout. npm elapsed 647441 ms; Bun elapsed 519750 ms under shared host load. Independent emitted-source coverage remains exactly 100 percent: 428/428 statements, 275/275 branches, 109/109 functions and 362/362 lines across nine runtime modules. Production audit reports zero vulnerabilities; pack inventory remains 43 allowlisted files, duplication zero and 63 declarations documented. Pinned dependencies and release thresholds are unchanged. Ignored dist output was rebuilt. Main history prefix checks pass for all five changed existing histories. Every round 2 finding is valid and fixed; no review thread replies, resolutions, mentions, merges or releases. Remote CI and CodeQL must run on the pushed head; existing publication/native-output-control blockers and the development advisory item remain outside this review correction."
  "2026-11-05T16:16:39.938Z",codex-agent,"Pushed implementation commit 77e42e85ec266eff74795c6621ae59effe6a9fb7 and verified the remote branch ref and commit object. PR description was updated through the REST API and verified exactly after gh pr edit hit its deprecated Projects Classic query. Remote verification gap: the PR API still reports old head 5c64956; the new implementation SHA has zero workflow runs and zero check runs. Its check-run endpoint initially returned HTTP 500 before recovering to an empty result. The open CodeQL alert still belongs to old synthetic merge ffab246, so it is not evidence against the fixed source or proof of a successful re-analysis. No current-head run URL exists yet. Previous-head CI failure is https://github.com/unbraind/pm-glossary/actions/runs/42054841845 and previous-head CodeQL analysis is https://github.com/unbraind/pm-glossary/actions/runs/42054841851 ; both are historical only. Current branch runs can be inspected at https://github.com/unbraind/pm-glossary/actions?query=branch%3Afeat%2Fglossary . Full local gates passed as recorded; exact pushed-head remote CI and CodeQL remain unverified. Claim remains released and item in_progress for orchestrator verification. No code or threshold changes in this receipt."
